<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling steady on dollar, falls on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling steady on dollar, falls on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained unchanged against the dollar but fell against the pound, the central bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>On the dollar, the shilling exchanged at a commercial mean rate of 600.1380, the same as Friday. Versus the pound, the shilling exchanged at 961.1240 compared to Friday's 956.1114.</p>
</text>
